# Copy this file to `.env` for local development. `.env` is gitignored.
#
# REQUIRED. The Azure OpenAI resource to generate images against:
# AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://<your-resource>.cognitiveservices.azure.com
#
# If the resource has key-based auth disabled, use an Entra ID (Azure AD)
# bearer token. The easiest path:
#
#   az login
#   npm run token      # writes AZURE_OPENAI_TOKEN below (valid ~1 hour)
#
# AZURE_OPENAI_TOKEN=<bearer token from `npm run token`>
#
# Alternatively, use a service principal, which auto-refreshes:
# AZURE_TENANT_ID=<tenant id>
# AZURE_CLIENT_ID=<app/client id>
# AZURE_CLIENT_SECRET=<client secret>
#
# Or an API key, if the resource has key-based auth enabled:
# AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY=<api key>
#
# Defaults to a known-good value (see server/env.ts); override if your
# deployment needs a different one:
# AZURE_OPENAI_API_VERSION=2025-04-01-preview
#
# Where version-controlled workflows and prompts live, relative to the project root:
# PIPELINES_DIR=pipelines
